        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo ALP-210, 10 Inch Angle Plate Security Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis angle plate security door latch protector is 10\" high and designed specifically for outswinging doors (door opens out of the room or building). For residential or commercial use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) or handlesets with no more than 5-1/2\" center to center between latch and deadbolt. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this heavy duty steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. Packaged with 1-1/2\" sheet metal screws for mounting to wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  Shorter <a href=\"/products/outswinging-door-6-inch-angle-plate-latch-guard-don-jo-alp-206\"><b>6\" Latch Guard Angle Plate</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-ALP-210_size.gif?v=1704354775\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo ALP-210 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with standard 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo ALP-210 Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 10 Gauge (.134\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: #8 x 1-1/2\" sheet metal screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ALP-210.pdf?v=1704262263\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo ALP-210 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
